"Biscuit downloads official Electron 41.10.7 (113 MiB on Apple silicon or 119 MiB on Intel; extracted payload about 275 MiB and 303 MiB respectively). The ZIP and Electron executable are SHA-256 verified before use. Biscuit retains the complete official runtime payload and its LICENSE / LICENSES.chromium.html notices in a private folder. Nothing is installed globally; personal browser profiles, Codex, and shared runtimes are untouched. Electron's sandbox and OS protections remain enabled." = "Biscuit 會下載官方 Electron 41.10.7（Apple silicon 版本為 113 MiB，Intel 版本為 119 MiB；解壓縮後的內容分別約為 275 MiB 和 303 MiB）。ZIP 檔案和 Electron 可執行檔在使用前都會經過 SHA-256 驗證。Biscuit 會在私有資料夾中保留完整的官方執行環境內容，以及 LICENSE / LICENSES.chromium.html 通知檔。任何項目都不會全域安裝；個人瀏覽器設定檔、Codex 和共用執行環境均不受影響。Electron 沙箱和作業系統防護功能會維持啟用。";
"Biscuit downloads the configured GitHub release, verifies its SHA-256 digest when published, bundle identity, version, universal architectures, macOS compatibility, and code signature, then keeps your current app as a rollback copy before replacing it. Your data and preferences stay in place. The app folder must be writable; Biscuit never requests administrator access." = "Biscuit 會下載已設定的 GitHub 發行版本；若該版本有公布 SHA-256 摘要，便會驗證該摘要，並核對套件識別碼、版本、通用架構、macOS 相容性和程式碼簽章。替換之前，會先將目前的應用程式保留為回復副本。您的資料和偏好設定會維持原樣。應用程式資料夾必須可寫入；Biscuit 絕不會要求系統管理員權限。";
