"Connect downloads the official Electron 41.10.7 runtime only after confirmation and verifies the architecture-specific release ZIP and executable SHA-256 before use. The complete extracted release, including Electron.app and the ZIP-root LICENSE and LICENSES.chromium.html, stays private in Biscuit's data folder. ChatGPT Web uses a dedicated persistent Electron profile and the same named session partition; Biscuit never copies cookies or reads private history. Sign-in opens a visible Biscuit-owned ChatGPT window only after you choose Connect. The selected model remains the one shown in ChatGPT; Biscuit does not change or silently substitute it. Electron's Chromium sandbox and OS protections remain enabled. Disconnect is available only for a Biscuit-managed profile; an adopted existing session is preserved." = "只有在確認後才會下載官方 Electron 41.10.7 執行環境，並在使用前驗證符合架構的發行版 ZIP 和執行檔 SHA-256。完整解壓縮的發行版（包括 Electron.app，以及 ZIP 根目錄中的 LICENSE 和 LICENSES.chromium.html）會保存在 Biscuit 的資料夾中，不對外公開。ChatGPT Web 會使用專用且持續保存的 Electron 設定檔和同一個具名工作階段分割區；Biscuit 絕不會複製 Cookie 或讀取私人瀏覽紀錄。只有在您選擇「連線」後，才會開啟由 Biscuit 管理且可見的 ChatGPT 視窗。所選模型會維持 ChatGPT 中顯示的模型；Biscuit 不會變更或暗中替換模型。Electron 的 Chromium 沙箱和作業系統防護功能會維持啟用狀態。只有 Biscuit 管理的設定檔可中斷連線；採用的現有工作階段會予以保留。";
