"Use OpenAI's public Codex PKCE protocol with biscuit branding. Credentials are stored only in biscuit's Keychain. Device-code login is a distinct provider flow." = "使用 OpenAI 公開的 Codex PKCE 通訊協定，並採用 Biscuit 品牌識別。憑證僅儲存在 Biscuit 的 Keychain 中。裝置代碼登入是另一種獨立的提供者流程。";
"Use browser PKCE sign-in for native Claude. OAuth tokens are stored only in biscuit's separate Keychain service. Biscuit never reads Claude Code credentials; remaining usage is retrieved only when you explicitly select Refresh." = "使用瀏覽器 PKCE 登入原生 Claude。OAuth 權杖僅儲存在 Biscuit 獨立的 Keychain 服務中。Biscuit 絕不讀取 Claude Code 憑證；只有在您明確選取「重新整理」時，才會擷取剩餘用量。";
"Use language correction" = "使用語言校正";
"Uses Apple's Translation framework on macOS 15 or later. First use may ask macOS to download language models. Apple may collect usage metrics and language pair, but not text content. Translation only; no generated lessons." = "在 macOS 15 或以上版本使用 Apple 的翻譯架構。首次使用時，macOS 可能會要求下載語言模型。Apple 可能會收集使用指標和語言配對，但不會收集文字內容。僅提供翻譯，不會產生教學內容。";
"Uses Vision language correction to normalize recognized text." = "使用 Vision 語言校正功能，將辨識出的文字標準化。";
"Uses a Biscuit-owned Claude OAuth session through the official Messages streaming endpoint. Sign in from Account Settings; tokens are stored in a separate Biscuit Keychain service. Biscuit never reads Claude Code credentials; native Claude remaining usage is queried only when you explicitly select Refresh in Provider Settings." = "透過官方 Messages 串流端點，使用由 Biscuit 管理的 Claude OAuth 工作階段。請在「帳戶設定」中登入；權杖會儲存在獨立的 Biscuit Keychain 服務中。Biscuit 絕不讀取 Claude Code 憑證；只有在您於「提供者設定」中明確選取「重新整理」時，才會查詢原生 Claude 的剩餘用量。";
"Uses biscuit's own ChatGPT subscription session with the ChatGPT Codex Responses streaming endpoint. No CLI or API key is used; provider-side compatibility and account access may change." = "使用 Biscuit 自有的 ChatGPT 訂閱工作階段，並透過 ChatGPT Codex Responses 串流端點。此功能不使用 CLI 或 API 金鑰；提供者端的相容性和帳戶存取可能會變更。";
"Uses the language macOS currently prefers for text recognition." = "使用 macOS 目前偏好的文字辨識語言。";
"Verifying the ChatGPT session from its visible composer. The saved profile is preserved if verification fails." = "正在從 ChatGPT 可見的訊息輸入框驗證工作階段。若驗證失敗，將保留已儲存的設定檔。";
"Version" = "版本";
